            "fileSize": 25833353
          },
          "description": "The Soundtrekkers head to the South Pacific Ocean to capture the powerful, low-frequency sound of the world-famous Bloop, which has mystified scientists for decades. Once they record the one-of-a-kind sound, they accidentally pick up the sound of an argument between Peanut Butter and Jellyfish - two of the most bumbling blunderbusses under the sea! Soon, their fight devolves into the each of them acting out more and more destructive examples of just how bad they can be! The Soundtrekkers consult the Seven Cs Solver app, which suggests COLLABORATION. Molly, Jojo, and JP make waves in helping the brawling buffoons come together – as a semi-functioning, but still ridiculous, unit.\t",
